OL,3,ACarney calls Trump's fresh tariffs a
OL,4,A'miscalculation' after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney has said a
OL,8,Ffresh wave of US tariffs on Canada is a
OL,9,F"miscalculation" designed to "hurt and
OL,10,Fdivide us", after trade talks collapsed
OL,11,Flate on Friday.
OL,13,F"They asked too much and they offered
OL,14,Ftoo little," Carney told Canadians on
OL,15,FSaturday morning, adding the country
OL,16,Fwas now in a trade "war" after being
OL,17,Fhit with punishing new US duties.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
